        1787,
        1495,
        1898
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, it is a significant priority of the City of New York and in the best interest of all New Yorkers to combat antisemitism and to encourage dialogue and harmony among diverse communities across the City; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
